<h2 class="bold" id="accessibility"><a class="underline reset-text-decoration" href="feature-accordion#accessibility">Accessibility</a></h2>
<p>FeatureAccordion follows <a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria-practices/#accordion" class="underline">WAI-ARIA accordion pattern</a>:</p>
<ul>
<li>Each accordion item has proper ARIA attributes for screen readers</li>
<li>Keyboard navigation is supported (Tab to navigate, Enter/Space to toggle)</li>
<li>Images must include meaningful alt text via <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">imageAlt</span></span></code></span> prop</li>
<li>Use semantic headings within accordion content to maintain proper document structure</li>
</ul>
<p>For vanilla HTML implementations, render preview images directly in HTML. JavaScript switches already rendered images; it no longer generates missing preview markup.</p>
